  "notes": [
    "ঃ is called বিসর্গ (bishôrgo). It is a special Bangla sign, not a consonant or vowel.",
    "Historically, visarga represented a light breathy h sound after a vowel. In modern everyday Bangla it is relatively uncommon and mainly appears in words inherited from Sanskrit.",
    "The prefix-like form দুঃ- often carries a negative or difficult sense, while নিঃ- often suggests without, lacking, or free from.",
    "Do not confuse ঃ with ং or ঁ: ঃ is visarga, ং is anusvara, and ঁ is chandrabindu.",
    "Best ঃ words to memorize include দুঃখ, দুঃখিত, দুঃখের, দুঃখজনক, দুঃসংবাদ, দুঃস্বপ্ন, দুঃসময়, দুঃসহ, নিঃশ্বাস, নিঃশব্দ, নিঃসঙ্গ, নিঃসন্দেহে, and নিঃস্বার্থ."
